Likewise, cursed potions of monster detection ("Monsters sense the
presence of you") will always work. Cursed potions of invisibility
("For some reason, you feel your presence is known") can have the same
effect, but only a 20% chance.

If you don't have access to these resources, just throwing stuff at it
(preferably stuff that won't hurt it much or will generally miss, like
scrolls) has a 10% chance per throw; attacking the pet will have the
same effect, but is more likely to cause damage.

